==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (4,000%) spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
**3 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
**1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
4 Oldhorns at once may sound scary, but in practice they don't push that much harder than 1 alone; and unlike in [[Annin Pass]] or [[Mince Hill]], you're free to stall as long as you want before facing them. Your lineup should center on crowd-control units that can further stop the Oldhorns' advance, while the best Cat Cannon to use is either the Thunderbolt or the Breakerblast.

